  "releaseNotes": "Update MzIO version\nUpdate System.Data.SQLite.Core from 1.0.113.7 to 1.0.119\nAdd MzSQL.Insert for a spectrum whose peaks are given as m/z, intensity and ion mobility arrays\nAdd MzSQL.ReadSpectrumHeadersLazy, which reads the ID, MS level, scan time, precursor m/z, charge state and ion mobility of the spectra of a run from the description text without building the spectra\nAdd MzSQL.ReadSpectrumPeaksAsArrays, which reads the peaks of a spectrum as m/z, intensity and ion mobility arrays",
